    "description": {
      "value": "By suddenly altering gravity, you pull the target toward you.\n\nThe target is pulled 10 feet closer to you unless it succeeds at a Fortitude save. On a critical failure, it's also knocked prone. The effects of this spell change depending on the number of actions you spend when you Cast this Spell.\n\n**1A (somatic)** The spell targets one creature.\n\n**2A (somatic, verbal)** The spell targets one creature and pulls the target 20 feet instead of 10.\n\n**3A (material, somatic, verbal)** The spell targets up to 5 creatures."
